  "title": "Flowers Foods Announces Retirement of Chief Supply Chain Officer",
  "summary": "THOMASVILLE, Ga., April 8, 2026 – Flowers Foods, Inc. (NYSE: FLO) today announced that effective April 17, Tom Winters, chief supply chain officer, will retire from the company. Winters has been a valued member of the Flowers leadership team since 2022. A search for his successor is underway. “The exceptional leadership and expertise Tom has...",
